WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.453
Hi I'm Shivam Gupta This is Runway Guard Can

00:00:05.453 --> 00:00:08.982
your crypto treasury still pay your team A portfolio

00:00:08.982 --> 00:00:12.461
balance tells you what your assets are worth today

00:00:13.377 --> 00:00:16.032
It does not tell you whether the next payroll

00:00:16.045 --> 00:00:19.937
payment is covered if prices fall or funds become

00:00:19.988 --> 00:00:24.563
inaccessible Here is a fictional sample team It has

00:00:24.588 --> 00:00:28.983
crypto holdings twenty five thousand dollars in cash
and

00:00:28.983 --> 00:00:33.014
forty two thousand dollars in monthly operating costs
You

00:00:33.053 --> 00:00:37.112
can enter balances manually or import a C S

00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:42.371
V file Then schedule payroll and add individual
expenses

00:00:42.601 --> 00:00:47.165
Refresh fetches real CoinMarketCap prices The evidence

00:00:47.216 --> 00:00:51.366
view shows the response and timestamps behind the
calculation

00:00:51.596 --> 00:00:55.423
Now let's assume a forty percent decline in volatile

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:58.542
assets and a ten percent drop in U S

00:00:58.542 --> 00:01:03.490
D Coin These are assumptions not predictions The chart

00:01:03.503 --> 00:01:07.446
compares current and stressed coverage as expenses come
due

00:01:08.375 --> 00:01:12.600
Locked assets cannot fund those expenses A recurring
payroll

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:16.919
row schedules its share of monthly costs The app

00:01:16.932 --> 00:01:20.383
does not count that expense twice You can also

00:01:20.383 --> 00:01:23.876
simulate losing access to an asset and see how

00:01:23.876 --> 00:01:27.753
the available funds change The reserve preview
estimates how

00:01:27.753 --> 00:01:31.129
much cash we need for our chosen reserve period

00:01:32.045 --> 00:01:35.460
It shows which available volatile holdings could fill
the

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:39.388
gap under these assumptions This is a planning estimate

00:01:40.305 --> 00:01:45.086
The app does not execute trades Reported market volume

00:01:45.086 --> 00:01:49.156
does not guarantee sale proceeds A saved report
preserves

00:01:49.156 --> 00:01:54.428
the inputs prices and assumptions Someone else can
review

00:01:54.428 --> 00:01:57.918
the result after prices change We are starting with

00:01:57.918 --> 00:02:01.436
a focused problem for small teams funded by crypto

00:02:02.366 --> 00:02:05.356
The next step is to validate a weekly planning

00:02:05.356 --> 00:02:09.234
workflow with those teams then add paid reviews and

00:02:09.286 --> 00:02:12.944
alerts Runway Guard connects a changing market to a

00:02:12.944 --> 00:02:17.353
concrete question Can we cover the obligations coming
due
